	•	Section 3 Comments/Quotes: The primary MLP was compared with logistic regression, SVM, random forest, gradient boosting machine, and balanced random forest. Twenty-five preoperative variables associated with graft failure in univariate analyses were ranked using averaged logistic-regression coefficients across repeated 5-fold cross-validation, and the top nine variables with normalized absolute coefficients above 0.25 were retained. Grid-search hyperparameter optimization was reported. The MLP contained two 60-unit ReLU dense layers with dropout of 0.7 and a sigmoid output. SHAP DeepExplainer was used for interpretation.

