	•	Section 4 Comments/Quotes: Only patients with complete data for all selected preoperative variables were analysed, and no imputation was performed. Class imbalance was addressed using balanced class weights for several models and a balanced-random-forest implementation; the exact imbalance method used for the final MLP was not explicitly specified. Stratified 5-fold cross-validation preserved the graft-failure proportion in each fold. Exact fold-specific training and validation counts were not reported. Feature-selection and model-preparation procedures were described, but predictor scaling or normalization before MLP training was not explicitly reported. Source code and model weights were not reported.

